                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Honest, straightforward communication"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Fast turnaround times"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Family-level customer care"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Deep expertise with International® trucks"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-trust-us-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Our goal isn't just to replace your battery; it's to help you protect your investment and keep your routes running smoothly. When your semi truck battery shows signs of failure, don't wait for a breakdown. Sun State International has the parts, expertise, and dependable service you need to keep moving.",
                    "align": "left",
